        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you tired of accidentally hitting the wrong keys on your keyboard?",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you find yourself losing precious time because of a rogue Caps Lock or Windows key?",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Or maybe you're like me and have a keyboard with more keys than you actually need after mapping, leaving you with unnecessary clutter.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fear not, my friend, for there is a solution to this all-too-common problem: a 3D printed switch blocker for Cherry MX switches!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The size of the switch blocker is a perfect square of 18.8x18.8mm, with a height of 1mm.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "However, if you're worried about blocking LED light, you may need to increase the thickness.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "No worries though, because you can easily modify the design to make it work for you.↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But what really sets this switch blocker apart is the notch on all sides.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This ensures that the switch blocker stays securely in place and doesn't pop out at the most inconvenient times.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So whether you're in the middle of a high-stakes game or a crucial work project, you can rest assured that your switch blocker will stay put.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And the best part?",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You can download the model for this switch blocker from Tinkercad, a free 3D modeling website.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So even if you don't have any 3D modeling skills, you can still create your own custom switch blockers!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And if you're worried about the cost, don't be.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You can link many switch blockers together to save on printing costs.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In fact, you can get 40 switch blockers for around 10 USD, including shipping from mainland to Hong Kong when you order from Taobao.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So, what are you waiting for?",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Say goodbye to those frustrating accidental key presses and hello to a more efficient and enjoyable typing or gaming experience with your very own 3D printed switch blocker for Cherry MX switches.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx",
        "title": "3D Printed Switch Blocker Cherry MX",
        "url": "/blog/3d-printed-switch-blocker-cherry-mx/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Happy printing!",
